# Course-catalog build inputs — source PDFs the images/copy were extracted from (426MB +
# 107MB) and the raw, pre-dedup image dump (132MB). The live site only reads from
# assets/images/unique/, never these; nothing in index.html references them. Keeping them
# untracked/unignored is what caused `vercel --prod` to try uploading 511MB and fail on
# Vercel's 100MB single-file limit. Not deleted from disk — just kept out of git/deploys.
course-catalog-site/source-docs/
course-catalog-site/assets/images/raw-extracted/
